OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners call for greater
OL,4,Aprotection of river
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners gathered in Ironbridge on
OL,7,FSunday to raise awareness of the
OL,8,Fimportance of the River Severn and the
OL,9,Fplight to protect it from pollution.
OL,11,FOne of those marching, resident Helen
OL,12,FHarvey, told the BBC: "I live here and
OL,13,FI've seen the decline in the river over
OL,14,Fthe last 10 years - before it was
OL,15,Fteeming with wildlife there were plenty
OL,16,Fof plants growing along the river
OL,17,Fbank."
OL,19,FSevern Trent said it had invested #2
OL,20,Fbillion across the region on
OL,21,Fimprovements in the last year and
OL,22,Freduced storm overflow spills.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
